{"unit_id":"yan3536__dsh-cookie-janitor#card-zh","repo":"yan3536/dsh-cookie-janitor","commit":"ec3a1225aa184d0daefa57aee2c11317b665e1bb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cookie-janitor 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话 cookie 清理插件。它接入 Host 的 HTTP 服务，在请求进入应用前识别当前 authority 对应的认证 cookie，移除属于已停止监听端口的旧 cookie，并在响应中发送过期指令。若 Node 因请求头溢出拒绝请求，还可返回清理旧 cookie 的重定向。适合遇到旧会话 cookie 累积、请求头过大问题的 DSH Web 使用者；无需 API key，支持通过配置控制保留数量和溢出恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:144-173","lib/index.js:175-201","cordis.patch.yml:13-32"]}
{"unit_id":"yan3536__dsh-cookie-janitor#card-en","repo":"yan3536/dsh-cookie-janitor","commit":"ec3a1225aa184d0daefa57aee2c11317b665e1bb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cookie-janitor cleans stale DSH web session cookies. It attaches to the Host HTTP server, keeps the current auth cookie, removes cookies from stopped listener ports, and expires them in responses. For oversized headers, it can redirect while clearing stale cookies. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:144-173","lib/index.js:175-201","cordis.patch.yml:13-32"]}
