{"unit_id":"yan3536__dsh-cookie-janitor#feature-4","repo":"yan3536/dsh-cookie-janitor","commit":"ec3a1225aa184d0daefa57aee2c11317b665e1bb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cookie-janitor 的功能「清理策略配置」：可设置是否清理请求、保留多少其他端口 cookie、是否恢复溢出请求，以及监听等待时间和请求头上限。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:45-75","cordis.patch.yml:13-32"]}
